span begin="1:32.064" end="1:34.130">快迷失自</span><span begin="1:34.130" end="1:35.091">己</span> <span begin="1:35.091" end="1:37.158">我盼望无</span><span begin="1:37.158" end="1:37.938">期</span></p><p begin="1:38.222" end="1:44.144" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.222" end="1:40.228">夜空很寂</span><span begin="1:40.228" end="1:41.268">静</span> <span begin="1:41.268" end="1:43.242">你多么深</span><span begin="1:43.242" end="1:44.144">情</span></p><p begin="1:44.318" end="1:52.120" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.318" end="1:46.304">宇宙没声</span><span begin="1:46.304" end="1:47.333">音</span> <span begin="1:47.333" end="1:49.304">我需要澄</span><span begin="1:49.304" end="1:50.243">清</span> <span begin="1:50.243" end="1:50.485">我</span><span begin="1:50.485" end="1:50.920">的</span><span begin="1:50.920" end="1:52.120">爱</span></p></div><div begin="1:52.427" end="2:16.726" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:52.427" end="1:58.049" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:52.427" end="1:53.473">闭上眼就</span><span begin="1:53.473" end="1:54.274">看到</span><span begin="1:54.274" end="1:55.220">你</span> <span begin="1:55.487" end="1:56.462">梦中听见</span><span begin="1:56.462" end="1:57.274">你声</span><span begin="1:57.274" end="1:58.049">音</span></p><p begin="1:58.566" end="2:03.593" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:58.566" end="1:59.529">眼泪流淌</span><span begin="1:59.529" end="2:00.404">着思</span><span begin="2:00.404" end="2:00.861">念</span> <span begin="2:00.861" end="2:01.111">弥漫</span><span begin="2:01.111" end="2:01.522">在</span><span begin="2:01.522" end="2:01.811">无</span><span begin="2:01.811" end="2:02.379">尽</span><span begin="2:02.379" end="2:02.842">的夜</span><span begin="2:02.842" end="2:03.593">里</span></p><p begin="2:04.634" end="2:10.017" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:04.634" end="2:05.669">我无论走</span><span begin="2:05.669" end="2:06.385">到哪</span><span begin="2:06.385" end="2:07.332">里</span> <span begin="2:07.